[{"title":"道中","author":"释宗泐","text":"青石悬萝花羃幕，绿田分涧水泠泠。\n人家深住黄猿坞，渔网高张白鹭汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴淞江逢清明","author":"释宗泐","text":"吴淞江上看春雨，客路扁舟三月行。\n两岸人家插杨柳，不知今日是清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵图","author":"释宗泐","text":"析薪岸口晚风和，罢钓湾头月满蓑。\n相对无言成一笑，黄尘回首是非多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣城见吴溥泉","author":"释宗泐","text":"江海山林两故人，敝貂残衲总清贫。\n今朝叠嶂楼前过，不是五云坊口春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋塘小景 其一","author":"释宗泐","text":"西风昨夜到南塘，杨柳蒹葭色转苍。\n飞鸟独来荷柄立，不教凉露满莲房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋塘小景 其二","author":"释宗泐","text":"秋光淡淡水盈盈，曾在耶溪缓棹行。\n日莫采莲人散后，柳阴风度一蝉清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画梅","author":"释宗泐","text":"今人写花不写实，古人咏实不咏花。\n晋代清谈多少客，羞将勋业向人誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对鞠","author":"释宗泐","text":"病里看花更惜花，谁分秋色到禅家。\n一年一度催人老，相对无言日又斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词赠汤炼师","author":"释宗泐","text":"风送仙香度玉墀，朝天归路月明时。\n忽逢子晋云中下，借得龙笙鹤背吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"微宗雪江独棹图","author":"释宗泐","text":"艮岳秋深百卉腓，沙尘吹满衮龙衣。\n凄凉五国城边路，得似寒江独棹归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度潼关","author":"释宗泐","text":"潼关西去入秦京，今古人多此路行。\n谁料不缘名利客，黄尘扑面听车声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别陇头","author":"释宗泐","text":"帝遣山人远入戎，半年情绪客程中。\n陇头流水今朝别，人自西行水自东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰","author":"释宗泐","text":"溪寺曾栽数十丛，紫茎绿叶领春风。\n年来萧艾过三尺，白首看图似梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"释宗泐","text":"閒门寂寂掩芳春，坐看梨花带雨新。\n鸟自白头浑不觉，可堪啼向白头人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶作","author":"释宗泐","text":"竹外茅斋橡下亭，半池荷叶半池菱。\n匡床曲几坐终日，万叠青山一老僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图","author":"释宗泐","text":"绿水青山茂苑西，荷花开满越来溪。\n渔郎荡桨湾头去，五月深林谢豹啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘道士葬师","author":"释宗泐","text":"欲成仙道古来难，曾向先师学内丹。\n不省稚川尸解去，人间犹自葬空棺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄东轩","author":"释宗泐","text":"黄鞠初开白露零，淮河水落远山青。\n一声雁度秋云冷，吟到黄昏月满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵题宋孝宗朝马和之所画三篇诗图此图乃王风扬之水篇也","author":"释宗泐","text":"马卿独念宋中微，图写诗篇墨采辉。\n戍甫戍申都不及，西风淮岸铁为衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徽宗山鹊图","author":"释宗泐","text":"落日黄尘五国城，中原回首几含情。\n已无过雁传家信，独有松枝喜鹊鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景","author":"释宗泐","text":"数个幽篁著雨低，两株高树倚云齐。\n钱塘惟有空山在，莫是閒情写会稽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观吴子行别仇山村诗作绝句吊之","author":"释宗泐","text":"吹箫人去竹房空，海内犹怜学术工。\n最是西泠桥畔路，淡烟疏柳夕阳中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天台归老图","author":"释宗泐","text":"白头天外未归人，江上看图愧此身。\n閒却溪头半间屋，桃花流水几经春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图","author":"释宗泐","text":"危峰削玉出云端，仙馆霜清古木寒。\n记得匡庐秋雨后，彭郎湖口倚篷看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岩潭道中","author":"释宗泐","text":"古木湾头渔艇，夕阳山下人家。\n风送一溪白浪，秋来满路黄花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"释宗泐","text":"风过如闻玉佩，雨馀似长龙孙。\n静爱此君高致，长日幽斋闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中小景二首 其一","author":"释宗泐","text":"谷口松杉无路，云中鸡犬谁家。\n仙客不归春老，洞门千树桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中小景二首 其二","author":"释宗泐","text":"四山一片秋色，野客独坐茅亭。\n渡头红叶如雨，石上长松自青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过柳湖忆故人杨生","author":"释宗泐","text":"寒云栖短柳，疏雨洒平芜。\n不见旧诗客，空怜水满湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"释宗泐","text":"窗外芭蕉雨，檐前蟋蟀声。\n如将不平意，相诉到天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿午峰","author":"释宗泐","text":"山中未云寂，半夜有松涛。\n不寐初来客，开门月正高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓朱溪","author":"释宗泐","text":"投竿溪水深，散发朝日上。\n高歌不逢人，心与晴川广。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲社钟","author":"释宗泐","text":"方深区内缘，久负社中约。\n惆怅莫钟声，徘徊度林薄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花庄水轩望清远不至","author":"释宗泐","text":"望君水轩西，恨杀前村树。\n日暮溪雨来，扁舟在何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题厓瀑图","author":"释宗泐","text":"飞瀑洒寒冰，危梁跨碧层。\n天涯图里看，白发未归僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景","author":"释宗泐","text":"孤村带寒鸦，远山涵夕雾。\n渡头人未归，日落风吹树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水竹居图","author":"释宗泐","text":"山人水竹居，画图看更好。\n十年不归来，茅屋秋风老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘皋烟雨图","author":"释宗泐","text":"翠袖湘江曲，秋林泪点斑。\n冥冥烟雨里，不见九疑山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚凉","author":"释宗泐","text":"晚凉池上亭，坐来心似水。\n雨过竹林青，风吹豆花紫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白以中西塘即景 其一","author":"释宗泐","text":"茅屋夜然灯，中有读书者。\n门外是官街，更深犹走马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白以中西塘即景 其二","author":"释宗泐","text":"落日鸡鸣埭，何人射雉回。\n北湖山月上，相送暮钟来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白以中西塘即景 其三","author":"释宗泐","text":"千门甲第高，四海狼烟息。\n独有周亚夫，时严柳营壁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心远亭","author":"释宗泐","text":"此心天地宽，幽亭寄閒静。\n独坐卷疏帘，落花春昼永。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江送别","author":"释宗泐","text":"江头杨柳树，秋雨更萧萧。\n可惜长条尽，那堪折短条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听松","author":"释宗泐","text":"逸响依岩切，清声绕枕寒。\n只疑幽谷底，急雨泻惊湍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松风涧水图","author":"释宗泐","text":"泠泠涧中水，瑟瑟松上风。\n大音自无听，月白千山空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独竹图","author":"释宗泐","text":"独立不偶俗，直干排高云。\n曾过首阳下，永怀孤竹君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题顾仲瑛雅集图","author":"释宗泐","text":"良时不再逢，嘉会难复得。\n斯人亦云亡，玉山空黛色。\n有生能几何，忽如驹过隙。\n昨日歌舞地，回首成陈迹。\n临淮秋雨朝，览图增太息。\n黄鹄招不来，萧条望八极。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送一初讲经还京师奉诏住天禧寺","author":"释宗泐","text":"凤城夜来雨，南风生绿槐。\n良友舍我去，老怀谁与开。\n晨鸡戒蓐食，使者行相催。\n空馀淮甸月，长照讲经台。\n中都寡名缁，有此万人特。\n问法常满堂，白日无虚席。\n去留系重轻，山川为改色。\n风雨旧房前，萧条芳草积。\n相知二十年，相见辄倾倒。\n平生江海游，如此眼中少。\n白首送归情，何以写怀抱。\n晓日幽林中，和鸣有黄鸟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远山楼为严子明作","author":"释宗泐","text":"去年曾上远山楼，楼上疏帘不下钩。\n一点峰峦青髻出，半空台殿采云浮。\n烟生近郭千村暝，水落长淮万里秋。\n门外红尘深没马，何人知有此清幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南阁偶成","author":"释宗泐","text":"南阁一跻攀，川原指顾间。\n野烟低度水，暮雨暗连山。\n去马黄沙路，征帆碧树湾。\n不知人世里，今古有谁閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张士衡画竹","author":"释宗泐","text":"谁写琅玕近石傍，半丛春雨半秋霜。\n云门山客岂无意，老干不如新笋长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢生山居五事 其一 耕田","author":"释宗泐","text":"前村后村雨歇，舍南舍北水生。\n借问南山扣角，何如谷口深耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢生山居五事 其二 牧牛","author":"释宗泐","text":"绿草茸茸满蹊，牛迹远近都迷。\n烟外数声桐角，溪东吹过溪西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢生山居五事 其三 灌畦","author":"释宗泐","text":"抱瓮归来日暮，高槐树下月明。\n唤取邻翁对坐，一樽浊酒同倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢生山居五事 其四 采药","author":"释宗泐","text":"日出长镵在手，独入千山万山。\n忽见桃花流水，谁知不是人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢生山居五事 其五 洗竹","author":"释宗泐","text":"杂生千个万个，净洗三丛两丛。\n眼底亭亭玉立，美人含笑迎风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"释宗泐","text":"白云生远岑，明月照空谷。\n松下两仙翁，行歌紫芝曲。\n霜清镜湖水，木落剡溪山。\n寂寞草堂客，看云终日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙梅","author":"释宗泐","text":"月白罗浮夜，波生洛浦春。\n梦中相见处，对雪写风神。\n湘妃出鲛宫，玉佩随风举。\n不见九疑山，愁云隔远浦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耕雨","author":"释宗泐","text":"鸠鸣桑雨深，蓑笠耦耕叟。\n短歌三两声，东风动杨柳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙江送别图","author":"释宗泐","text":"相送龙湾雨雪寒，齐秦千里各之官。\n青山绿水江南意，留取新图别后看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归南昌","author":"释宗泐","text":"白首相逢又别离，好怀开处不多时。\n江头柳树春风里，怪底千丝与万丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图","author":"释宗泐","text":"仙阁崖根桂树丛，钓丝溪口荻华风。\n支公吟对千峰晚，放鹤归来月满空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠竹芙蓉","author":"释宗泐","text":"眼前清丽是秋光，翠竹疏疏映拒霜。\n王母燕归风露冷，碧云影里淡红妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈生","author":"释宗泐","text":"叠嶂楼前九曲坊，曾同墨客坐华堂。\n卿家好事能投辖，帘卷春风白昼长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭水离亭图","author":"释宗泐","text":"太白峰前渭水边，柳亭春雨惜离筵。\n江南回首三千里，一度披图一惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感时","author":"释宗泐","text":"不谓承平日，居然有乱离。\n感时空自叹，避地欲何之。\n蛇虺江淮塞，鲸鲵渤澥危。\n青山虽满眼，无处著茅茨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题然本中已山楼","author":"释宗泐","text":"此地昔年过，凭高兴若何。\n市声归院少，山色入楼多。\n白日下空际，片云生碧阿。\n今朝易为感，回首一长歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送术士李光道归越","author":"释宗泐","text":"送客都门道，落花逢暮春。\n还持鬼谷术，归隐海东滨。\n流水溪头屋，白云松下身。\n他年应辟荐，来访赤城人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨园图","author":"释宗泐","text":"千树花如雪，梨园春昼迟。\n霓裳齐起舞，凤管不停吹。\n院落深沈处，君王醉醒时。\n玉人怜貌损，折取半开枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"药庵","author":"释宗泐","text":"卿家药作庵，因病却相谙。\n品数居南北，温凉识苦甘。\n洗当泉脉活，晒待日光酣。\n四壁无佗物，应知老更耽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"释宗泐","text":"六载江淮厌用兵，遗民处处困徭征。\n蕃商旧日多归汉，海漕于今不入京。\n万垒鼓鼙生夜月，几家砧杵落秋城。\n西风无限思归客，王粲登楼最有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"近闻方东轩新造轩成复用前韵赋诗以寄","author":"释宗泐","text":"移家淮甸久，玉树已成林。\n江汉放情早，文章用意深。\n雅无浮俗态，独有古人心。\n庄舄何为者，区区动越吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画竹","author":"释宗泐","text":"美人湘北岸，翠盖倚中洲。\n斜日雨初歇，断云横未收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江山小景","author":"释宗泐","text":"长林带晚照，极浦起寒波。\n茅屋远山外，扁舟归兴多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"释宗泐","text":"茅屋隔榆林，孤舟系柳阴。\n明时无逸客，谁在白云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题张天师耆山庵","author":"释宗泐","text":"闻说耆峰胜地偏，庵居别是一壶天。\n雅宜河上仙翁住，稳称山中宰相眠。\n坞口白云深似海，阶前瑶草碧如烟。\n闭门不语坐终日，妙入无为合自然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳日西涧独游","author":"释宗泐","text":"三月三日天气好，西峰独往成幽寻。\n黄鸟交交柳烟重，斑鸠喔喔桑雨深。\n草花已满古石路，涧水乱穿修竹林。\n寄语兰亭脩褉客，吾将此地为山阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]